{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
    "name": "i2c-3 — Image to Cell API",
    "description": "Postman collection covering every endpoint of the Image-to-Cell v3 backend. Run **00 / Login** once to populate `{{access_token}}` and `{{user_id}}`, then every other request inherits the auth headers automatically.\n\n**Collection variables you MUST fill** before running anything authed:\n- `email` and `password` — staging Supabase user credentials\n- `org_id` — your organization UUID (X-Organization-ID)\n\n**Already pre-filled:**\n- `supabase_url`, `supabase_anon_key`, `i2c_url`\n\n**Auto-filled by Login script:**\n- `access_token`, `refresh_token`, `user_id`\n\nThe **Auth tests** folder runs negative checks (no token, wrong X-User-ID, invalid token) to verify the JWT gate is enforcing.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 — Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (password grant)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('access_token present', () => pm.expect(r.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.test('user.id present', () => pm.expect(r.user.id).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', r.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', r.refresh_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', r.user.id);",
                  "console.log('✓ Token stored for', r.user.email, '(user_id:', r.user.id, ')');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{supabase_anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": ["{{supabase_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "password" }]
            },
            "description": "Logs in to Supabase with email/password and stores `access_token`, `refresh_token`, `user_id` as collection variables. Run this first; the token is valid for 1 hour."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', r.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', r.refresh_token);",
                  "console.log('✓ Token refreshed');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "apikey", "value": "{{supabase_anon_key}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabase_url}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=refresh_token",
              "host": ["{{supabase_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "v1", "token"],
              "query": [{ "key": "grant_type", "value": "refresh_token" }]
            },
            "description": "Use this when the access_token expires (after 1 hour) without re-typing credentials."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
